@startuml AD4_PlayMyRecording
!include act.iuml
title Activity Diagram – Play My Recording
|User|
start
:Press "Play my recording";
|Faseeh System|
:Get recorded audio\n(getAudioData);
if () then ([audioData exists])
  :Play user recording\n(play);
  stop
else ([no recording])
  :Show "record your\nrecitation first";
  stop
endif
@enduml
